 [["All five rules in CLAUDE.md", "**Request-as-guarantee** for the strict ones"], ["No triggers logged", "Lines are speculative"]],
 "The artifact passes only if every no-exceptions rule sits in a hook or deny rule and every CLAUDE.md line has a logged trigger.",
